stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "Plan status (bcp_status)" as PlanStatus {
        [*] --> NeedsReview: create plan<br/>Dept Head, RMD, ADMIN
        NeedsReview --> Ready: BIA complete + sign-off<br/>RMD, CRO, ADMIN
        Ready --> NeedsReview: next_review_date reached
        Ready --> Outdated: review SLA missed
        NeedsReview --> Outdated: review SLA missed
        Outdated --> NeedsReview: plan refreshed
    }

    state "Test status (test_status)" as TestStatus {
        [*] --> NotTested
        NotTested --> Passed: drill meets RTO/RPO
        NotTested --> Failed: drill misses targets
        Passed --> Overdue: next_test_date passed
        Failed --> NeedsRemediation
        NeedsRemediation --> Passed: re-test succeeds
        Overdue --> Passed
        Overdue --> Failed
    }

    note right of PlanStatus
        Required on create: title, department,
        business_function, recovery_time_objective,
        recovery_point_objective, owner_id.
        reference_number assigned by trigger.
    end note

    note right of TestStatus
        Guard (validate_bcp_bia_test_fields):
        any test_* field requires test_type,
        test_scope and last_tested_date;
        bia_* fields require bia_assessment_date.
        Failed test forces plan back to Needs Review.
    end note
